//! LSP package: wire-format helpers and an optional document-cache shim.
//!
//! ```loi
//! import "lib/lsp.loi"            // broad package import
//! import "lib/lsp/protocol.loi"   // fine-grained import
//! ```
//!
//! `protocol.loi` formats notifications in pure Loi; `shim.loi` is the only
//! file with `extern flow`s and needs `--c-source lib/lsp_shim.c`.

open import "lsp/protocol.loi"
open import "lsp/shim.loi"
